      "guideFxJuiceTitle": "💥 Combo flash & hard-drop shockwave",
      "guideFxJuiceBody": "Tetris, T-spin, and 3+ combos shake the board with a 0.15s neon zoom flash. A hard drop sprays shockwave particles along the bottom.",
      "guideDasTitle": "🎯 DAS / ARR precision handling",
      "guideDasBody": "In Settings → Handling, tune DAS (100–300ms, default 150), ARR (15–80ms, default 33), and soft drop (1x–20x, default 10x). Applies to keyboard and the 7-button pad.",
